    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a Kongming-inspired construction scoring game where you can put your heart and soul into building powerful pieces to win.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game will be a new layout, and of course you can unlock different game packs to get a new experience by winning, and you can earn enough to meet the requirements of each tier until you win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A combination of wisdom and luck (you may have to count a few moves later)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Difficulty, Different Bags - Each win unlocks a new difficulty and a new bag to give you a new experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different card packs, 3 different difficulty levels, and over 30 different items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of the help items that the game gives you, using scramble and movement to break up the situation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you find joy in the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a Kongming-inspired construction scoring game where you can put your heart and soul into building powerful pieces to win.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game will be a new layout, and of course you can unlock different game packs to get a new experience by winning, and you can earn enough to meet the requirements of each tier until you win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A combination of wisdom and luck (you may have to count a few moves later)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Difficulty, Different Bags - Each win unlocks a new difficulty and a new bag to give you a new experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different card packs, 3 different difficulty levels, and over 30 different items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of the help items that the game gives you, using scramble and movement to break up the situation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you find joy in the game.</p>",
